x-4 sm:pt-4"><header class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1C1C1A] px-4 py-2.5 shadow-[0_8px_30px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]"><a aria-label="Captionit home" href="/"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center gap-2 " role="img" aria-label="Captionit"><img src="/brand/opencaption-icon-light.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" height="28" class="block shrink-0 select-none" style="height:28px;width:auto" draggable="false"/><span class="font-styled font-black leading-none tracking-tight" style="font-size:22.959999999999997px">Caption<span class="font-serif font-normal italic">it</span></span></span></a><nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]/80 lg:flex xl:gap-7"><a href="#how" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">How it works</a><a href="#control" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">Editor</a><a href="#looks" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">Looks</a><a href="#privacy" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">On your device</a><a href="#faq" class="py-1 hover:text-[#FFFFEB]">FAQ</a></nav><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hidden whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FFFFEB]/80 transition hover:text-[#FFFFEB] sm:block" href="/login">Sign in</a><a class="hidden items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#34D399] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#141412] sm:flex" href="/start?choose=1">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><button aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-[#FFFFEB]/15 lg:hidden"><span class="relative block h-3 w-4"><span class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[2px] w-4 bg-[#FFFFEB] transition "></span><span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[2px] w-4 bg-[#FFFFEB] transition "></span></span></button></div></header></div><main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 pt-16 sm:pt-20"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#34D399]">Pricing</p><h1 class="mt-3 max-w-2xl font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.015em] sm:text-5xl">Free while you learn it. Paid when you outgrow it.</h1><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70">Every plan includes the full editor, all 150 caption templates and every AI tool — paid plans raise the limits, they don’t unlock features. Paid plans are 30-day passes: you pay once, nothing renews or charges you again automatically.</p><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"><section class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border p-6 border-white/10 bg-[#1C1C1A]" aria-label="Free plan"><h2 class="font-sora text-[17px] font-bold">Free</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/60">The full studio, free while you find your feet.</p><p class="mt-5"><span class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold">$0</span><span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB]/60">forever</span></p><ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/85"><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>10 projects</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Videos up to 5 minutes</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Uploads up to 50 MB</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Exports kept for 7 days</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Editor, Clipper and Creator Studio included</span></li></ul><p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Up to <!-- -->10<!-- --> projects · videos up to <!-- -->2 GB<!-- --> <!-- -->on this device · videos to <!-- -->5<!-- --> min · exports kept <!-- -->7<!-- --> <!-- -->days</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 font-sora text-[13.5px] font-semibold border border-white/25 text-[#FFFFEB]" href="/start">Start free</a></section><section class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border p-6 border-white/10 bg-[#1C1C1A]" aria-label="Starter plan"><h2 class="font-sora text-[17px] font-bold">Starter</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/60">More room for a posting habit.</p><p class="mt-5"><span class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold">$4</span><span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB]/60">for 30 days</span></p><ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/85"><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>50 projects</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Videos up to 30 minutes</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Uploads up to 200 MB</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Exports kept for 30 days</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Email support</span></li></ul><p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Up to <!-- -->50<!-- --> projects · videos up to <!-- -->4 GB<!-- --> <!-- -->on this device · videos to <!-- -->30<!-- --> min · exports kept <!-- -->30<!-- --> <!-- -->days</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 font-sora text-[13.5px] font-semibold border border-white/25 text-[#FFFFEB]" href="/settings/billing">Get Starter</a></section><section class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border p-6 border-[#34D399]/60 bg-[#1C1C1A]" aria-label="Plus plan"><h2 class="font-sora text-[17px] font-bold">Plus</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/60">For creators publishing every day.</p><p class="mt-5"><span class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold">$6</span><span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB]/60">for 30 days</span></p><ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/85"><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>200 projects</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Videos up to 1 hour</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Uploads up to 500 MB</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Exports kept for 60 days</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Email support</span></li></ul><p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Up to <!-- -->200<!-- --> projects · videos up to <!-- -->8 GB<!-- --> <!-- -->on this device · videos to <!-- -->60<!-- --> min · exports kept <!-- -->60<!-- --> <!-- -->days</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 font-sora text-[13.5px] font-semibold bg-[#34D399] text-[#0B1512]" href="/settings/billing">Get Plus</a></section><section class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border p-6 border-white/10 bg-[#1C1C1A]" aria-label="Pro plan"><h2 class="font-sora text-[17px] font-bold">Pro</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/60">The most headroom we offer.</p><p class="mt-5"><span class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold">$10</span><span class="ml-2 text-[13px] text-[#FFFFEB]/60">for 30 days</span></p><ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/85"><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>1,000 projects</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Videos up to 3 hours</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Uploads up to 2 GB</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Exports kept for 60 days</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[7px] h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]"></span><span>Priority email support</span></li></ul><p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/55">Up to <!-- -->1,000<!-- --> projects · videos up to <!-- -->8 GB<!-- --> <!-- -->on this device · videos to <!-- -->180<!-- --> min · exports kept <!-- -->60<!-- --> <!-- -->days</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 font-sora text-[13.5px] font-semibold border border-white/25 text-[#FFFFEB]" href="/settings/billing">Get Pro</a></section></div><div class="mt-14 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#FFFFEB]/70"><h2 class="font-sora text-[16px] font-bold text-[#FFFFEB]">How paid plans work</h2><p>Pay once and the higher limits apply to your account for 30 days. When the 30 days end your account returns to Free — nothing is charged again, and your projects are never deleted for dropping back. Buying the same plan again while it’s active adds 30 days to your current period; switching to a different plan starts a fresh 30 days on the new plan.</p><p>Prices are shown in <!-- -->US dollars<!-- --> <!-- -->based on where you’re visiting from. Payments are processed by Cashfree over UPI, cards and netbanking in India, and cards internationally.</p><p>Questions about a payment? Write to<!-- --> <a class="underline decoration-[#34D399]/60 underline-offset-2" href="mailto:work.techhacksai@gmail.com">work.techhacksai@gmail.com</a> <!-- -->— plan changes, refunds and everything money-related are handled by a person, not a bot.</p></div></main><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1E1E1B] pt-20 pb-10 text-[#FFFFEB]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-16 pb-16"><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Product</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#how">How it works</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/auto-caption-generator">Auto caption generator</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/transcribe">Transcribe</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#looks">Looks gallery</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D3